       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "Halvern Dam at Brindlemark in the Assek Valley was reported damaged on 9 September 2025, opening a dam safety emergency.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Damage extended to the right abutment of the dam, and the alert level was raised from Yellow to Orange the following morning.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "A mandatory evacuation moved roughly 11,800 residents from Brindlemark, with residents of Ferris Hollow also evacuated.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Sorrel Basin Water Authority provided information on the condition of the dam while the evacuation orders remained in force.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
